# Cruelclaw's Heist: "You choose a nonland card from it". Bot2 holds only Islands (and draws another one from the
# promised gift, before the other effects, CR 702.174j): no card can be chosen, nothing is chosen and
# nothing is exiled, so Bot1 has nothing to cast; the spell still resolves and Bot2 keeps all eight Islands.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Cruelclaw's Heist
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cruelclaw's Heist.Cast
Bot1.Accept
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 8
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Cruelclaw's Heist
